cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use GnosisLab-VM, please cite this software."
type: software
title: "GnosisLab-VM: virtualized, isolated environment for reproducible scientific research"
authors:
  - family-names: Bikeyev
    given-names: Alexander
    affiliation: Cloudcell Limited
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/cloudcell/gnosislab-vm"
url: "https://github.com/cloudcell/gnosislab-vm"
version: "0.0.2"
date-released: 2026-10-14
abstract: >-
  GnosisLab-VM provides a KVM/libvirt virtualized deployment environment
  for GnosisLab, with a guest agent interface, isolated scientific MCP
  services, separate execution of potentially untrusted experiment code,
  controlled data movement, and reproducible template build and import
  workflows. GnosisLab scientific-process services are developed in the
  companion gnosislab repository.
keywords:
  - gnosislab
  - scientific-method
  - virtualization
  - KVM
  - libvirt
  - reproducibility
  - sandboxing
  - model-context-protocol
